.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F2f0d2dac3b7ec74bd1935334692c12de91933a8d')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">9월 통합과학1</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">1.31MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eda4b68e532703eb41a2a1a862494d82d63014a3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eda4b68e532703eb41a2a1a862494d82d63014a3\" data-origin-width=\"728\" data-origin-height=\"469\"></div><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 100%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/120768ce1e7c732669f7935887446eda1bd9fd6e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/120768ce1e7c732669f7935887446eda1bd9fd6e\" data-origin-width=\"746\" data-origin-height=\"292\"></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/461d712dab03d529a060f872e874b176cf58fd5d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/461d712dab03d529a060f872e874b176cf58fd5d\" data-origin-width=\"721\" data-origin-height=\"255\"></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3b1dec55358deda237f9dcbc32cadc458e0efff8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3b1dec55358deda237f9dcbc32cadc458e0efff8\" data-origin-width=\"716\" data-origin-height=\"195\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>&#160;</p><p>이런 AI 분석을 바탕으로</p><p>통합과학 내신 기출문항을 1개 입력하면</p><p>문항 분석 및 대안 문항 6개를 만들어주는 앱을 개발하였습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8b9f009420d8fcd4b4492798d7a211c45846d237\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"752\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8b9f009420d8fcd4b4492798d7a211c45846d237\" data-origin-width=\"1137\" data-origin-height=\"561\"></div><p>1. 기존 문항 1개를 화면 캡쳐하기</p><p>2. 시험지 이미지 란에 Ctrl+V 하기</p><p>3. 강조 영역 3가지에서 체크하기</p><p>4. 문항 생성 클릭~</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\"><b>(통합과학 문항 생성기)</b></span><b></b><b></b></p><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\"><b><a href=\"https://share.gemini.google/xOtswlplDOCw\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://share.gemini.google/xOtswlplDOCw</a></b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>* 교과서 pdf에서&#160; 한 페이지를 캡쳐해서 넣어도,</p><p>해당 교과서 내용으로 수능형 문항을 만들어줍니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/86671ccec6b48d35ef2ea3db66fc0707b462e7ab\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"457\" height=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/86671ccec6b48d35ef2ea3db66fc0707b462e7ab\" data-origin-width=\"616\" data-origin-height=\"539\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1bbfb1fc7a3cf4878085e383549c3e06dc8d7b6e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1bbfb1fc7a3cf4878085e383549c3e06dc8d7b6e\" data-origin-width=\"1182\" data-origin-height=\"670\"><div class=\"figcaption\">* 이 문항 좋네요!</div></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
